== Syntax.Advanced.Money..ctor(decimal)
Entry — when a new Money is created
SetMember — set Amount to amount
== Syntax.Advanced.Money.op_+(Money, Money)
Entry — when operator +(a, b) is called
Return — return new(a.Amount + b.Amount)
== Syntax.Advanced.Money.op_checked_+(Money, Money)
Entry — when operator checked +(a, b) is called
Return — return new(checked(a.Amount + b.Amount))
== Syntax.Advanced.Money.op_true(Money)
Entry — when operator true(m) is called
Return — return m.Amount != 0
== Syntax.Advanced.Money.op_false(Money)
Entry — when operator false(m) is called
Return — return m.Amount == 0
== Syntax.Advanced.Money.op_+=(Money)
Entry — when operator +=(other) is called
